{c: Verse 1}
[F]Ajeeb dastaan [F]hai ye,        [F]Kahan shuru kahan kha [Gm]tam
[Gm]Yeh manzilein hai kaun [Bb]si,        [C]Na woh samajh sake na [F]hum
[F]Yeh roshni ke saath kyon [Bb],        [Bb]Dhuaan utha chirag se [F]
[C]Yeh khwaab dekhti hoon [Bb]main,        [Bb]Ke jag pari hoon [C]khwaab [F]se
[F]Mubarakein tumhe ke [Bb]tum,        [Bb]Kisi ke noor ho [F]gaye
[C]Kisi ke itne paas [Bb]ho,        [Bb]Ke sab se door [C]ho [F]gaye
[F]Kisi ka pyar leke [Bb]tum,        [Bb]Naya jahan basaao [F]ge
[C]Yeh shaam jab bhi aaye-gi [Bb] ,        [Bb]Tum humko yaad [C]aao [F]ge
